Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 4.1.38-rt44 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 4.1.38 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v4.1-rt
  Head SHA1: ddd791408853a84b58dfe5eeaeca9517862b6a22


Or to build 4.1.38-rt44 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v4.x/linux-4.1.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v4.x/patch-4.1.38.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/4.1/patch-4.1.38-rt44.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
